From: Buon-Omba <302052335+Buon-Omba@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: gs101-bluejay: add ramoops at the stock location

Stock bluejay (CP2A.260705.006 vendor_boot DTB) keeps ramoops at
0xfd3ff000, 4 MiB, console 2 MiB and pmsg 2 MiB. Use the same region so
kernel logs survive a warm reset.

Signed-off-by: Buon-Omba <302052335+Buon-Omba@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-bluejay.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-bluejay.dts
@@ -13,6 +13,18 @@
 	model = "Bluejay";
 	compatible = "google,gs101-bluejay", "google,gs101";
 	chassis-type = "handset";
+
+	reserved-memory {
+		#address-cells = <2>;
+		#size-cells = <1>;
+
+		ramoops@fd3ff000 {
+			compatible = "ramoops";
+			reg = <0x0 0xfd3ff000 0x400000>;
+			console-size = <0x200000>;
+			pmsg-size = <0x200000>;
+		};
+	};
 };
 
 &cont_splash_mem {
